[{"w":0.064444441795349125,"text":"6","h":0.058139536332110886,"y":0.015988371659525935,"x":0.042222223668992101},{"w":0.50888889312744146,"x":0.15777777247794597,"text":"A matter of fact","h":0.034883721799266576,"y":0.024709301981907461},{"w":0.082222223281860352,"text":"6.J","x":0.055555554683143916,"y":0.1264534901043598,"h":0.053779066436144718},{"h":0.018895349307936127,"y":0.11046511597103192,"text":"VOCABULARY","x":0.19333333891756482,"w":0.24222221374511715},{"h":0.010266966917076847,"y":0.14816326543910396,"text":"The media • truth and falsehood","w":0.2666666603088379,"x":0.19111111206780329},{"text":"• adjective-noun collocations","x":0.1888888869444445,"h":0.011627906487912565,"y":0.16279069806418323,"w":0.23999999999999999},{"x":0.18888888698869949,"y":0.17877551036116046,"w":0.082222223281860352,"h":0.0087244894066635936,"text":"• adverbs"},{"x":0.064444449452609548,"w":0.23111110687255862,"y":0.22367346943276234,"text":"SHOW WHATYOU KNOW","h":0.011836734693877582},{"text":"1 Choose the collocation that is not correct in each","y":0.2485465119304624,"w":0.41111110687255858,"x":0.055555553563720751,"h":0.011627906487912454},{"x":0.075555556555555528,"w":0.080000000000000002,"h":0.0087209296713069984,"y":0.26453488396521863,"text":"sentence."},{"h":0.011836734693877582,"w":0.38222221374511717,"y":0.2804081630901224,"text":"On the way to college, | listen to podcasts \/ music","x":0.10222223283114489},{"text":"streaming services \/social media posts)\/ the radio.","x":0.099999991399242455,"y":0.29346938813555934,"w":0.38888889312744135,"h":0.01321665861168686},{"x":0.097777781139982811,"y":0.30813953455120346,"h":0.013084955020826627,"text":"Most evenings, I watch online video clips \/","w":0.32888889312744141},{"w":0.29111110687255859,"h":0.011627906487912565,"x":0.10000000575816508,"y":0.32122093047697398,"text":"news blogs \/ reality TV \/ drama series."},{"w":0.395555534362793,"y":0.33575581424635381,"x":0.075555562855640593,"text":"2 The best places to get news from are reality TV \/","h":0.011627906487912565},{"h":0.013203606897470799,"y":0.34883720908487592,"x":0.10222223550488273,"w":0.38444442749023439,"text":"news apps \/ local newspapers \/ social media posts."},{"h":0.01318343649105147,"x":0.075555573604546289,"w":0.42666664123535153,"text":"3 Maria loves being up-to-date with what's going on in","y":0.36191860443371304},{"w":0.40444442749023429,"h":0.016070242122728007,"text":"the world, so she often reads celebrity twitter feeds \/","y":0.37209302356869711,"x":0.10000001492154925},{"y":0.39098837228898953,"text":"newspaper editorials \/ news blogs \/ drama series.","w":0.37555553436279293,"x":0.10222223907786258,"h":0.011627906487912565},{"h":0.013248695062131333,"text":"4 Sam's always online and posts \/ retweets \/ shares \/","w":0.40888889312744142,"x":0.075555547584427674,"y":0.40244897930139389},{"x":0.10222223687197091,"h":0.013089701594138581,"text":"feeds \/ 'likes' lots of things. I don't know how he has","y":0.41714285692636344,"w":0.39777774810791011},{"w":0.32888889312744141,"y":0.4665306122330406,"x":0.051111106251094149,"text":"WORD STORE 6A Truth and falsehood","h":0.010213573611512428},{"x":0.048888894346381447,"y":0.48691860432470158,"w":0.41555553436279297,"h":0.013081395674724883,"text":"3 Complete the dialogue. The numbers in brackets"},{"w":0.39111110687255868,"x":0.075555561585942815,"text":"show the number of letters in the missing words.","y":0.50285714300006934,"h":0.011836734693877582},{"h":0.01554682673240193,"w":0.24292873382568358,"text":"The first two letters are given.","y":0.51426539869095322,"x":0.075193892404039675},{"y":0.53469387746106967,"x":0.075555565016330165,"h":0.01346938775510198,"w":0.42222221374511726,"text":"Host: Welcome to the programme. Each week on 'Why"},{"h":0.013259373878946046,"y":0.54796511589810271,"text":"I decided to be a ...' we talk to young people who","w":0.38444442749023444,"x":0.12222222940303099},{"y":0.56395348858017169,"w":0.35555553436279297,"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"have recently started their career and ask them","x":0.12444445948527008},{"y":0.57836734711599935,"h":0.011836734693877582,"text":"to explain their choice. This week, Amy Jones is","x":0.12222223434377166,"w":0.36444442749023442},{"text":"with us. She studied journalism and now works as","h":0.011627906487912565,"w":0.37777778625488279,"y":0.5930232562037181,"x":0.12222221737255858},{"y":0.60897959198718365,"w":0.38444442749023439,"h":0.010206454140799459,"text":"a reporter. Amy, what attracted you to this career?","x":0.12222223710673447},{"x":0.073333333135606762,"h":0.011836734693877582,"w":0.39333332061767573,"y":0.62204081630256081,"text":"Amy: I wanted to be a journalist because | think it's"},{"text":"important to give people authentic stories that","y":0.63662790725749718,"w":0.35777778625488277,"h":0.011627906487912565,"x":0.1222222135114476},{"h":0.018104196665238437,"text":"don't distort (7) the truth so they can form their","x":0.12197266451754459,"w":0.36051734924316409,"y":0.64760553324984094},{"x":0.1222222407156574,"w":0.34666664123535157,"text":"own opinions. I'm afraid many news agencies","y":0.66569767461457097,"h":0.011627906487912565},{"x":0.12222222520778622,"h":0.011627906487912565,"y":0.68023255823860174,"w":0.1155555534362793,"text":"these days 'mi_"},{"w":0.20444444656372074,"y":0.68023255803109683,"x":0.30444444082925082,"text":"_ (9) the public deliberately","h":0.01323682979661589},{"w":0.24666666030883788,"x":0.12222222842891434,"h":0.013154960165218443,"text":"and they most likely have an 2ag","y":0.69469387737054522},{"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"(6)","x":0.44444444482689927,"y":0.69622093062232282,"w":0.024444444179534897},{"x":0.12222222504671773,"text":"when they do it. Sometimes, they even spread","y":0.70930232591302045,"w":0.35333332061767586,"h":0.011627906487912565},{"text":"3fa","h":0.010174418079609837,"y":0.72383720954062147,"x":0.12222222317514206,"w":0.033333332538604737},{"x":0.20000000560892281,"h":0.010338158120914431,"text":"(4) news or ta","y":0.72367346935396792,"w":0.12222221374511719},{"y":0.72529069802784596,"h":0.011627906487912565,"w":0.12222222328186039,"x":0.38222222016462537,"text":"_(6) with photos"},{"x":0.12000000603266066,"text":"to support what they write. \"Ma","y":0.73836734728353282,"w":0.24444442749023437,"h":0.013086141469527246},{"text":"(12)","x":0.47111111133421191,"y":0.73982558158162515,"h":0.011627906487912565,"w":0.035555555820465101},{"x":0.12197363107971952,"y":0.75023682193635199,"h":0.01674681215870133,"w":0.3316147232055664,"text":"the media is more common than you would"},{"text":"imagine. I think journalists have a responsibility to","h":0.014167830798090697,"x":0.11988559298675938,"y":0.76691128064737135,"w":0.38022846221923823},{"h":0.011627906487912565,"y":0.78197674423666386,"w":0.36222221374511715,"text":"tell the truth, although I also think readers have","x":0.11999999886818234},{"text":"a responsibility not to believe everything","w":0.31111110687255861,"x":0.12222222823038727,"y":0.7963265308294396,"h":0.013469387755102091},{"y":0.81102040801829889,"text":"Host: Some interesting points there, Amy. So, what can","x":0.073333347115993805,"h":0.011836734693877582,"w":0.42444442749023431},{"y":0.82693877542428262,"text":"newsreaders do about these issues?","x":0.12222222320022766,"h":0.0089795918367346905,"w":0.27555555343627924},{"text":"Amy: Well, when you read any news story, you shouldn't","y":0.84000000014560383,"h":0.013197674653968039,"w":0.43333332061767577,"x":0.073333340246717602},{"x":0.1198604789550506,"y":0.85407205577628409,"h":0.014239609387456165,"w":0.12250126838684082,"text":"take it at 'fa"},{"h":0.010360702203244587,"x":0.28222222479819065,"text":"_(4) value. You should check","y":0.8559183673925197,"w":0.21777776718139652},{"h":0.011355091795629435,"y":0.86859570949517007,"w":0.05383485794067383,"x":0.12197146045384433,"text":"the lac"},{"w":0.06237887859344482,"h":0.0119894