spaper every week. They","x":0.75555556270559809,"y":0.29505813915391665,"w":0.21777776718139641},{"h":0.014362352332290218,"x":0.58865893922297186,"w":0.25820812225341805,"y":0.30803575656107474,"text":"have some interesting newspaper"},{"y":0.322674418849067,"text":"about issues affecting our town.","w":0.24444444656372077,"x":0.58888889088480623,"h":0.011627906487912454},{"x":0.56444444405336758,"y":0.3357558140041057,"text":"5 We sometimes watch music video","w":0.28222221374511713,"h":0.011627906487912565},{"h":0.011836734693877582,"x":0.59111111708223918,"text":"online, but usually use a music","w":0.23111110687255854,"y":0.3502040816656754},{"x":0.58888889978783709,"y":0.36482558163976464,"h":0.011627906487912454,"text":"service to download songs.","w":0.20888887405395506},{"x":0.58211842150937176,"text":"Do you ever","w":0.10465204238891601,"h":0.01244875888435204,"y":0.37749655060944964},{"h":0.011836734693877582,"text":"interesting things with","x":0.82222223245450377,"y":0.37918367355672467,"w":0.16888887405395514},{"text":"your friends on social media?","y":0.39098837226476468,"h":0.011627906487912565,"w":0.22444444656372076,"x":0.58888889063480632},{"y":0.40552325602196837,"w":0.12666666030883789,"h":0.010174418079609726,"text":"7 Katia made a","x":0.56444444920669212},{"x":0.82888889161723478,"w":0.15333333015441897,"text":"recently about good","y":0.40552325581452708,"h":0.013252254408232966},{"h":0.013232084001813638,"y":0.41860465095624222,"x":0.591111125463048,"w":0.37555553436279288,"text":"books for teenagers. Over a hundred people have"},{"text":"listened to it already.","y":0.43082118720946538,"h":0.014162633467693753,"x":0.58857596766225351,"w":0.16291643142700196},{"text":"WORD STORE 6B | Adjective-noun collocations","w":0.39111110687255857,"x":0.537777779897054,"h":0.013120550817372845,"y":0.4665306122997861},{"y":0.48837209283608707,"x":0.53777779760454625,"w":0.42666664123535147,"text":"4 Complete the pairs of sentences with the words in","h":0.013260560327646775},{"h":0.011741874850526135,"text":"the box.","y":0.50284999266203589,"w":0.071154742240905677,"x":0.56220040660122483},{"h":0.0087209296713069984,"text":"basis","y":0.53052325603643946,"x":0.58444444484444447,"w":0.040000000000000036},{"h":0.0087209296713069984,"text":"commitment","x":0.64000000446391014,"y":0.53052325604612949,"w":0.10888888359069826},{"text":"feeling","x":0.75237490741425395,"y":0.52853112178901285,"w":0.059655413627624498,"h":0.014492134561344128},{"x":0.82666666697865632,"text":"gain","w":0.035555555820465101,"h":0.010174418079609726,"y":0.53197674435772424},{"y":0.54254072044896062,"h":0.014306027159398882,"w":0.21834720611572267,"x":0.58197753405891761,"text":"information source story"},{"y":0.56530612258463875,"x":0.58888889790930166,"h":0.011836734693877471,"w":0.29777776718139648,"text":"I watch the news on TV on a daily basis"},{"x":0.59111110997112815,"h":0.011627906487912565,"w":0.39111110687255857,"text":"Do you tend to read newspapers on a regular basis?","y":0.57994186075798171},{"text":"The papers are awash with","y":0.59302325586903282,"x":0.58888889183114512,"w":0.20222221374511717,"h":0.013099193183743307},{"y":0.59447674427899355,"h":0.010174418079609726,"text":"about","w":0.046666665077209513,"x":0.92444444483176569},{"text":"the elections.","x":0.58888889433836311,"y":0.60755813982162921,"w":0.10444443702697759,"h":0.010174418079609837},{"text":"I feel like I'm constantly being bombarded with","y":0.62063953477528289,"x":0.58666665795589201,"w":0.35777778625488277,"h":0.013238016245316508},{"text":", but too little of it is about","h":0.011836734693877582,"x":0.71777778267891434,"w":0.20666666030883785,"y":0.63510204075882437},{"y":0.64970930256999726,"text":"important issues such as climate change.","x":0.58888890016746676,"w":0.30888887405395504,"h":0.011627906487912565},{"w":0.16888887405395514,"x":0.58888889912117048,"y":0.66279069743880037,"h":0.013127670288085924,"text":"This paper has a clear"},{